{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00396","headline":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 雍和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郊坛展敬，严配因心。\n孤竹箫管，空桑瑟琴。\n肃穆大礼，铿锵八音。\n恭惟上帝，希降灵歆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}